# di — environment variables. Copy to .env (gitignored; mise loads it).
# Server config lives in config.yaml / config.example.yaml — every key has a
# DI_<SECTION>__<KEY> env override (see .agents/docs/config-reference.md).

# ── Zero-conf demo LLM (dev) ───────────────────────────────
# Shared demo endpoint for `mise run dev:server:demo-llm`; values come from
# your org secrets/env — never commit the real url.
# DI_DEMO_LLM_BASE_URL=
# DI_DEMO_LLM_MODEL=
# DI_DEMO_LLM_API_KEY=

# ── Test mode ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Mounts /v1/test/* debug routes (ping/state/events/pipeline/smoke).
# DI_TEST_MODE=1

# ── SPA build-time tunables (packager knobs; the shipped bundle is baked
#    into the di binary, so these only take effect at `mise run build`) ──
# Timeout budgets from apps/web/src/lib/timeouts.ts (ms):
# VITE_VOICE_WS_OPEN_TIMEOUT_MS=10000
# VITE_VOICE_MODEL_LOAD_TIMEOUT_MS=600000
# VITE_VOICE_MODEL_DOWNLOAD_TIMEOUT_MS=600000
# VITE_VOICE_TTS_SENTENCE_TIMEOUT_MS=15000
# VITE_VOICE_LLM_TURN_TIMEOUT_MS=90000
# VITE_VOICE_LLM_SMOKE_TEST_TIMEOUT_MS=90000
# VITE_VOICE_TTS_TEST_TIMEOUT_MS=5000
# /api/health probe budget + pending-turn retry policy:
# VITE_SERVER_PROBE_TIMEOUT_MS=2000
# VITE_TURN_POST_RETRIES=3
# VITE_TURN_POST_RETRY_BASE_MS=1000
# Default transformers.js browser-llm model id:
# VITE_TRANSFORMERS_MODEL_ID=onnx-community/Qwen3-0.6B-ONNX
